# USE WHEN accessing knowledge through shortcuts, optimizing references, or navigating the knowledge system efficiently

# Shortcut Reference System

## Overview

This document provides optimized shortcut references for accessing knowledge in the 1000xbrain cognitive architecture. These shortcut references offer more intuitive, shorter paths to frequently accessed content without requiring knowledge of the full directory structure.

## Shortcut Reference Format

Instead of referencing the full path, shortcut references allow accessing content through simplified paths:

```
Standard reference:
message-command: @parameters/reference/guides/tool-patterns.mdc

Shortcut reference:
message-command: @reference/guides/tool-patterns.mdc
```

